Read **`.cursor/skills/live-mic-invariants/SKILL.md`** and the **Live mic** section in `AGENTS.md`.

Release-blocking: tap must stay listening (every language) until second tap or ~2s silence after speech. Do not set iOS `rec.continuous` false, do not kill Apple Web Speech after two empty `onend`s, do not bootstrap `/health` on mic teardown, do not dump Vercel checkpoint HTML into the error banner. Auto-speak barge-in: start Web Speech before pausing TTS; never `speechSynthesis.cancel()` / `audio.load()` on the preserve-session path. Background: stop mic tracks immediately on hide/pagehide — do not leave the orange Safari pill on.
